          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi akagya aha ngoma aina emyaka mushanju. Kandi akagimaraho emyaka 40 ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Zibia owa Berisheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu makiro ga Yehoyada Omukuhani Nyamukuru muno Yoashi akashemeleza Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akamushwelerera abakazi babili, kandi yazara abojo n'abaisiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire yamazire ebiro aha ngoma aramura kushemeza Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayeta abakuhani n'Abalevita, abagambira ati, “Mugende omu bigo bya Yuda, Isiraeli yona babahe empiha z'okushemeza Rwensinga ya Ruhanga wanyu buli mwaka. Ekigambo eki mukikore bwangu.” Kyonkai Abalevita tibakikozire bwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo ayeta Yehoyada Omukuhani Nyamukuru muno amubaza ati, “Kubaki otaragiire Balevita kushoroza muli Yuda na Yerusalemu mushoro ogwatairweho Musa omwiru w'Omukama, ogwo yataireho enteko aha rw'Eihema ly'Obusinge bw'Omukama?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okugamba atyo kuba batabani ba Atalia, omukazi mubi olinya, bakaba batemire Rwensinga y'Omukama, bakwata ebintu byona ebyabaire bihongeirwe Rwensinga egyo babikoza omu kufukamira ebihuuku bya Baali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Omukama Yoashi aragira bakora esanduku bagiteka aheru y'ekihigi kya Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yuda yona na Yerusalemu barangira abantu kuletera Omukama Ruhanga omushoro ogwo Musa omwiruwe yabaire ataireho Isiraeli omw'irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatwazi bona n'abantu bona bashemelerwa, baleta emishoro nibagiteka omu shanduku bagijuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli orwo esanduku Abalevita bagileteraga abakuru ab'omukama yabaire ataireho, bamazire kubona okwo einamu empiha zingi, omuhandiki w'omukama n'omukuru ayabaire atairweho Omukuhani Nyamukuru muno, bakwata esanduku bagihyamu empiha bashuba bagigarura aha mwanya gwayo. Bakoraga batyo buli kiro n'empiha bakashombokya zingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yoashi na Yehoyada bazikwasaga balinya abalebeleraga eikora lya Rwensinga, bonene abo nibo batekagaho abombeki b'amabaare n'abaselemara b'okushemeza Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakozi bachwazikana, bashemeza Rwensinga ya Ruhanga eba mpya mara bagigumisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire bamazire, empiha ezasigaireho bazileta bazanjulira Omukama na Yehoyada, ezo nizo zakozire ebikwato bya Rwensinga eby'okukoza emilimo y'okutambisa ebihongo by'okwokibwa, n'esahani z'obunuma, n'ebikwato ebindi eby'ezahabu n'efeza. Omu makiro ga Yehoyada batambaga ebitambo by'okwokibwa obutosha omuli Rwensinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada Omukuhani Nyamukuru akura agurusha, atahya aina emyaka 130. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubyalira omu Kigo kya Daudi omu magashani g'abakama, kuba akakora ebirungi omuli Isiraeli, yakolera Ruhanga na Rwensingaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada Omukuhani Nyamukuru kayabaire yafire, abatwazi ba Yuda baija babandamira Omukama Yoashi, mara Yoashi wenene abakunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwensinga y'Omukama Ruhanga wa baishenkuru baginagaho, bakolera ebishushani bya Ashera n'ebihuuku. Omukama anigalira muno Yuda na Yerusalemu, abatura entambara yabo egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kandi ashuba abatwekera abarangi b'okubamugaruraho, babakomeeka, kyonkai tibahuliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo Mwoyo wa Ruhanga yatungamiire Zekaria eya Yehoyada omukuhani, atungama omu mbaga abagambira ati, “Ruhanga nagamba ati, ‘Kubaki nimuchwa emihango y'Omukama? Leba n'okugoshoka timukigoshoka, orwo mumuhoiremu nawe yabahwamu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai bamubanja, na Yoashi abaragira kumuteza amabare omuli nyarubuga ya Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Omukama Yoashi ataijukire birungi ebyo Yehoyada ishe Azaria yamukoleire, akaita n'omutabani. Zekaria kayabaire nasangwa agamba ati, “Omukama alibabona!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nzindo y'omwaka eihe ly'Abasiria litabalira Yoashi. Baija Yuda na Yerusalemu baita abatwazi, n'ebyo banyagire babitwekera omukama wa Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo eihe ly'Abasiria lyabaire litabaire n'abantu bake, Omukama hakabaanaga eihe lihango muno lya Yuda omu mikono, aha rw'enshonga y'okumunaga wenene, Omukama Ruhanga wa baish'enkurubo. Nikwo Abasiria babonabonyize batyo Yoashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire bamurugireho, bakasiga bamuhutaize muno, abaramatabe bamushenga aha rw'okushangwa aisire mutabani wa Yehoyada Omukuhani Nyamukuru, bamwitira aha kitandakye. Nikwo yatahize atyo, bamubyalira omu Kigo kya Daudi, kyonkai tibamubyaliire mu magashani ga bakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamubanzire ni Zabadi eya Shimeati Omuamoni na Yehozabadi eya Shimuriti Omuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
